    449  4129							; ADVANCED SOUND values (the menu's choices index these). SID vibrato depth
    450  4129							; x 1/4096 of the frequency (61 = 1/4 semitone), rate x 1/262 Hz, delay in
    451  4129							; 4 ms; glide 1/2^k of the way per 4 ms; tremolo depth of 15, rate x 1/655
    452  4129							; Hz; SID detune (8 = FAT's, about 7 cents); Game Boy warble.
    453  4129		       1e 3d 5b 7a uVibDepT   .byte.b	30, 61, 91, 122
