    430  6f9d							; ------------------------------------------------------------ tuning
    431  6f9d							; tuneC = PLAYING's FINE TUNE + the Synthcart's TUNE TO (while it's in use),
    432  6f9d							; in cents (-100..+100). The Game Boy gets it as master tune (CC 103), the
    433  6f9d							; NES in its bends (tuneN, 1/64 semitones), the SID in its note frequencies
    434  6f9d							; (SidTune; the notes sounding move at once). MATCH KEY sets the key's root
    435  6f9d							; once, when it changes.
